1
00:00:09,134 --> 00:00:11,574
It's... raining.

2
00:00:12,704 --> 00:00:14,194
It's raining.

3
00:00:14,944 --> 00:00:16,114
But, but!

4
00:00:16,114 --> 00:00:18,204
It doesn't matter. Kobato is ready!

5
00:00:18,384 --> 00:00:19,934
I am going to collect more kompeito!

6
00:00:27,154 --> 00:00:29,184
That was close!

7
00:00:31,264 --> 00:00:34,824
Do... Ba... To...

8
00:00:37,334 --> 00:00:40,394
Now I'm all covered in mud, thanks to you!

9
00:00:46,644 --> 00:00:49,774
Kobato.

10
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:52,614
Kobato.
What should I do?

11
00:00:52,614 --> 00:00:57,014
Kobato.
Even the most obvious of things

12
00:00:57,924 --> 00:01:01,224
Are always such a challenge

13
00:01:01,224 --> 00:01:03,994
I want to laugh when I'm happy

14
00:01:03,994 --> 00:01:08,294
And sing whenever I want

15
00:01:08,864 --> 00:01:11,294
Is all

16
00:01:12,604 --> 00:01:16,974
They say my dreams will come true someday

17
00:01:17,404 --> 00:01:20,674
But when will "someday" come?

18
00:01:20,674 --> 00:01:24,164
I can't wait forever

19
00:01:24,314 --> 00:01:30,084
On "1, 2, 3!" I'll spread open my arms

20
00:01:30,084 --> 00:01:35,294
And let the light gather around me

21
00:01:35,294 --> 00:01:38,124
Where is it?

22
00:01:38,124 --> 00:01:41,464
Please tell me what I can do

23
00:01:41,464 --> 00:01:44,304
I make the most of getting hurt

24
00:01:44,304 --> 00:01:47,204
And run with all my might

25
00:01:47,204 --> 00:01:51,174
Despite how many dozens of times I fall

26
00:01:51,174 --> 00:01:54,214
And start crying

27
00:01:54,214 --> 00:01:58,234
I surprise myself

28
00:01:58,714 --> 00:02:02,874
In how much I believe in tomorrow

29
00:02:12,494 --> 00:02:14,864
...A Gift from the Rain.

30
00:02:14,864 --> 00:02:17,204
...A Gift from the Rain.
D-Don't worry about getting muddy, Ioryogi-san.

31
00:02:17,204 --> 00:02:18,064
D-Don't worry about getting muddy, Ioryogi-san.

32
00:02:18,334 --> 00:02:20,524
The rain will wash the mud off.

33
00:02:22,004 --> 00:02:23,174
What do you mean, don't worry?!

34
00:02:23,174 --> 00:02:25,304
Then I'll be soaking wet!

35
00:02:25,874 --> 00:02:27,104
Kobato?

36
00:02:30,914 --> 00:02:32,214
Good morning.

37
00:02:32,214 --> 00:02:34,114
Ms. Sayaka?

38
00:02:38,684 --> 00:02:41,024
Um... Ms. Sayaka?

39
00:02:41,424 --> 00:02:42,684
What is it?

40
00:02:42,824 --> 00:02:44,654
Where are you going?

41
00:02:45,664 --> 00:02:47,494
I'm going to your home, Kobato.

42
00:02:47,794 --> 00:02:49,164
Huh?

43
00:02:55,274 --> 00:02:56,574
Here we are.

44
00:02:56,574 --> 00:02:58,544
Wow!

45
00:03:00,004 --> 00:03:03,044
But, but... it is all right for me to live here?

46
00:03:03,044 --> 00:03:05,914
Sure, as long as you don't mind.

47
00:03:06,514 --> 00:03:08,314
Come along, let's go inside.

48
00:03:08,314 --> 00:03:09,754
Yes ma'am!

49
00:03:13,284 --> 00:03:14,954
Let me introduce you.

50
00:03:15,494 --> 00:03:17,424
This is my friend Chitose.

51
00:03:17,424 --> 00:03:19,594
She manages this apartment building.

52
00:03:19,594 --> 00:03:22,754
H-How do you do?! My name is Kobato Hanato.

53
00:03:23,334 --> 00:03:27,394
Kobato, is it? It's nice to meet you.
I'm Chitose Mihara.

54
00:03:28,034 --> 00:03:32,134
Don't hesitate to ask me if you
have any questions at all.

55
00:03:32,344 --> 00:03:33,474
Yes ma'am!

56
00:03:33,474 --> 00:03:35,804
Thank you Chitose, for all your help.

57
00:03:36,474 --> 00:03:39,934
Well then Kobato, I must be getting
back to the kindergarten.

58
00:03:40,084 --> 00:03:43,214
Oh, yes! Thank you very much.

59
00:03:43,284 --> 00:03:45,374
I'll be over later to help.

60
00:03:46,124 --> 00:03:49,954
There you go again.
Always worried about others.

61
00:03:51,394 --> 00:03:52,624
Kobato?

62
00:03:52,724 --> 00:03:53,784
Yes?

63
00:03:54,534 --> 00:03:55,754
Welcome aboard.

64
00:03:56,294 --> 00:03:58,794
She seems like such a nice person!

65
00:03:59,464 --> 00:04:01,634
This is where you say, " Thank you for having
me, I hope I'm not too much trouble."

66
00:04:02,474 --> 00:04:04,174
Uh, thank you for having me.

67
00:04:04,174 --> 00:04:06,194
My name is Kobato Hanato.
I hope you're not too much trouble.

68
00:04:06,744 --> 00:04:08,474
No, you're not the one being troubled.

69
00:04:09,214 --> 00:04:11,714
What time do you think your
things will be arriving?

70
00:04:11,714 --> 00:04:13,474
Huh?! Um, uh, well!

71
00:04:14,484 --> 00:04:15,784
This is it!

72
00:04:16,054 --> 00:04:17,854
But where's your bedding and such?

73
00:04:17,854 --> 00:04:19,284
I don't have any!

74
00:04:19,754 --> 00:04:20,914
Oh?

75
00:04:21,054 --> 00:04:23,544
Well then come along, let me show you around.

76
00:04:24,494 --> 00:04:25,624
Okay!

77
00:04:26,464 --> 00:04:28,864
This is a beautiful building.

78
00:04:28,864 --> 00:04:30,834
Do you think so? Thank you.

79
00:04:32,434 --> 00:04:34,234
Oh, wow!

80
00:04:34,234 --> 00:04:37,504
What a nice room, don't you
think so Ioryogi-san?

81
00:04:39,074 --> 00:04:40,304
Ioryogi-san?

82
00:04:41,014 --> 00:04:43,134
Huh? Huh?

83
00:04:43,614 --> 00:04:45,844
Where could he have disappeared to?

84
00:04:52,224 --> 00:04:54,194
Dobato...

85
00:04:54,694 --> 00:04:56,924
How could you dare leave me behind?!

86
00:04:57,864 --> 00:04:58,894
How many times do I have to tell you?!

87
00:04:58,894 --> 00:05:01,264
I am a stuffed toy here!

88
00:05:01,264 --> 00:05:03,284
Sorry!

89
00:05:03,634 --> 00:05:05,104
Just give me a break!

90
00:05:07,774 --> 00:05:08,334
Hey!

91
00:05:08,334 --> 00:05:08,834
Y-Yes, yes.
Hey!

92
00:05:08,834 --> 00:05:10,134
Y-Yes, yes.

93
00:05:11,204 --> 00:05:13,234
Kindergarten's about to start.

94
00:05:14,614 --> 00:05:16,444
That's right!

95
00:05:19,514 --> 00:05:20,704
We'd better hurry!

96
00:05:21,354 --> 00:05:22,684
We're going to be late!

97
00:05:27,824 --> 00:05:30,224
I'm sorry. Are you okay?

98
00:05:30,764 --> 00:05:34,054
I'm fine. I'm more worried about him.

99
00:05:35,764 --> 00:05:38,564
I'm so sorry. You're all covered in mud.

100
00:05:40,164 --> 00:05:42,164
He's kind of cute!

101
00:05:43,774 --> 00:05:46,244
Good! He's all cleaned up now.

102
00:05:46,974 --> 00:05:48,844
Here. See ya!

103
00:05:50,484 --> 00:05:52,384
Thank you very much!

104
00:05:53,014 --> 00:05:55,314
She knows how to be considerate, unlike you.

105
00:05:59,954 --> 00:06:01,014
Kobato.

106
00:06:02,024 --> 00:06:03,454
How did you like your room?

107
00:06:03,624 --> 00:06:07,154
Great! There was a roof and I could lie around
on the floor, and it was wonderful!

108
00:06:07,594 --> 00:06:09,924
That's good. I'm glad to hear it.

109
00:06:12,534 --> 00:06:14,054
Kobato!

110
00:06:15,404 --> 00:06:16,834
Let's play!

111
00:06:16,904 --> 00:06:19,064
I'm cleaning right now.

112
00:06:19,204 --> 00:06:20,934
Then I'll help!

113
00:06:21,044 --> 00:06:22,674
Me too!

114
00:06:22,774 --> 00:06:24,374
Thank you very much!

115
00:06:25,084 --> 00:06:26,584
What do you want me to do?

116
00:06:26,584 --> 00:06:27,514
Let me see.

117
00:06:27,514 --> 00:06:28,954
Hey, what about me?

118
00:06:30,154 --> 00:06:32,624
You didn't have to go so far as
to get her an apartment.

119
00:06:32,854 --> 00:06:36,884
Why, everyone seems to be so
happy since she arrived.

120
00:06:37,494 --> 00:06:38,964
Don't you go bullying her now.

121
00:06:39,994 --> 00:06:41,864
You're just going to...

122
00:06:44,104 --> 00:06:46,224
You're just going to get yourself hurt again.

123
00:06:51,304 --> 00:06:52,744
Maybe you're right.

124
00:06:54,544 --> 00:06:58,134
Right now you need to be wary of everyone.

125
00:07:02,314 --> 00:07:04,754
Isn't it nice that the rain has let up?

126
00:07:04,924 --> 00:07:10,554
There's no kindergarten tomorrow, so I'm
going to collect a lot of kompeito, Ioryogi-san!

127
00:07:10,964 --> 00:07:13,154
Yeah!

128
00:07:23,234 --> 00:07:26,364
But it was sunny until just
a few minutes ago.

129
00:07:26,744 --> 00:07:29,074
This is why I told you to bring an umbrella.

130
00:07:29,174 --> 00:07:30,944
I'm sorry.

131
00:07:34,684 --> 00:07:37,344
It doesn't look like it's going
to stop any time soon.

132
00:07:37,884 --> 00:07:39,654
I guess you'll just have to get wet.

133
00:07:40,224 --> 00:07:42,914
Hey! That's not fair, you staying dry!

134
00:07:44,464 --> 00:07:46,364
You don't have an umbrella?

135
00:07:47,094 --> 00:07:48,464
No...

136
00:07:48,564 --> 00:07:49,994
Well then, here.

137
00:07:51,834 --> 00:07:53,804
Please use it if you like.

138
00:07:56,104 --> 00:07:57,504
But...

139
00:07:57,674 --> 00:08:01,574
You can have it. I had it for customers, anyway.

140
00:08:03,444 --> 00:08:06,934
Um... I'll come and return
it when it stops raining!

141
00:08:08,384 --> 00:08:10,944
Okay. I'll be waiting for you.

142
00:08:11,154 --> 00:08:13,384
Yes! Thank you very much!

143
00:08:16,694 --> 00:08:19,754
That was a pretty normal
encounter, for you, Kobato.

144
00:08:20,534 --> 00:08:22,434
So you're going to keep this up?

145
00:08:22,994 --> 00:08:24,264
Yes!

146
00:08:24,604 --> 00:08:27,624
I'm going to gather information on people
who need their hearts mended here!

147
00:08:28,674 --> 00:08:30,364
I guess you could be right in a way.

148
00:08:30,604 --> 00:08:32,734
Looks like a lot of people use this place.

149
00:08:35,544 --> 00:08:37,634
Kobato is ready!

150
00:08:46,484 --> 00:08:49,454
I couldn't find any information.

151
00:08:51,794 --> 00:08:52,924
What's up?

152
00:08:52,924 --> 00:08:54,964
The umbrella I borrowed is gone!

153
00:08:54,964 --> 00:08:56,194
What?!

154
00:08:56,194 --> 00:08:59,134
Someone must have taken it by mistake.

155
00:08:59,364 --> 00:09:01,504
They probably just took it.

156
00:09:01,504 --> 00:09:04,834
What? Is it okay just to take
someone's umbrella?

157
00:09:05,074 --> 00:09:06,664
Of course not!

158
00:09:09,414 --> 00:09:11,034
Oh, no...

159
00:09:11,584 --> 00:09:14,744
That umbrella was lent to me by
the person at the cake shop.

160
00:09:16,814 --> 00:09:18,084
Hey.

161
00:09:19,554 --> 00:09:21,024
We meet again!

162
00:09:21,294 --> 00:09:23,394
Oh... yesterday...

163
00:09:23,394 --> 00:09:24,654
What's the matter?

164
00:09:25,094 --> 00:09:26,994
My umbrella's gone.

165
00:09:27,264 --> 00:09:28,494
Oh?

166
00:09:31,534 --> 00:09:32,364
Here!

167
00:09:32,364 --> 00:09:33,734
What?

168
00:09:34,074 --> 00:09:35,834
This is mine. I'll lend it to you.

169
00:09:36,304 --> 00:09:37,034
But...

170
00:09:37,034 --> 00:09:37,544
No worries.
But...

171
00:09:37,544 --> 00:09:38,174
No worries.

172
00:09:38,174 --> 00:09:40,074
My house is really close, anyway.

173
00:09:40,744 --> 00:09:43,574
Besides, if you don't have an
umbrella, you'll get him wet.

174
00:09:43,744 --> 00:09:45,144
Right?

175
00:09:46,144 --> 00:09:47,344
Hey Mutsumi!

176
00:09:50,824 --> 00:09:52,844
Be careful of that junk food.

177
00:09:53,454 --> 00:09:55,154
You'll get fat again.

178
00:09:58,464 --> 00:10:00,954
Shut up Katsuragi, you fool!

179
00:10:01,364 --> 00:10:02,734
Wait a minute!

180
00:10:02,734 --> 00:10:04,064
Um!

181
00:10:04,064 --> 00:10:05,634
Thank you very much!

182
00:10:05,634 --> 00:10:07,334
You wait for me or I'm going to hit you!

183
00:10:07,334 --> 00:10:09,864
You'd hit me even if I did wait!

184
00:10:10,074 --> 00:10:11,404
Say that again?!

185
00:10:11,504 --> 00:10:12,974
Hey! Katsuragi!

186
00:10:13,774 --> 00:10:19,304
There are those who will lend you their umbrella
even if it means getting wet themselves.

187
00:10:36,264 --> 00:10:37,854
Good morning!

188
00:10:38,134 --> 00:10:40,564
Good morning, Kobato.

189
00:10:44,574 --> 00:10:46,564
You've got floor markings on your cheek.

190
00:10:46,744 --> 00:10:47,864
Huh?

191
00:10:50,174 --> 00:10:52,574
S-See you later!

192
00:10:52,844 --> 00:10:54,484
How embarrassing!

193
00:10:54,484 --> 00:10:56,744
Floor markings on my cheek?!

194
00:10:56,814 --> 00:10:59,754
Chitose must have thought I was weird!

195
00:11:03,994 --> 00:11:05,514
Good morning!

196
00:11:05,794 --> 00:11:07,164
Huh?

197
00:11:07,734 --> 00:11:09,724
Thank you for the use of your umbrella.

198
00:11:10,094 --> 00:11:12,434
I'm surprised you found my school.

199
00:11:12,834 --> 00:11:17,864
Yes, well I went back to the cake shop to
apologize for having lost his umbrella

200
00:11:18,204 --> 00:11:21,104
and he told me that the green sailor
suits were this school's uniform.

201
00:11:22,574 --> 00:11:24,634
Ioryogi-san is grateful, too.

202
00:11:25,214 --> 00:11:26,574
Ioryogi?

203
00:11:26,984 --> 00:11:27,914
Yes.

204
00:11:27,914 --> 00:11:32,614
Oh, this doll? Wow, that's an unusual name.

205
00:11:33,554 --> 00:11:36,084
My name is Kobato Hanato.

206
00:11:36,394 --> 00:11:38,254
I'm Mutsumi Tadokoro.

207
00:11:38,564 --> 00:11:39,784
Mutsumi!

208
00:11:41,734 --> 00:11:44,324
Your hair's crooked in the back.

209
00:11:44,534 --> 00:11:47,504
Huh? Be quiet! Keep it to yourself!

210
00:11:48,134 --> 00:11:49,624
Oh no. Where, where?

211
00:11:49,734 --> 00:11:51,364
I don't see anything wrong.

212
00:11:52,474 --> 00:11:56,304
I have floor markings on my cheek.

213
00:11:57,944 --> 00:12:00,314
That really doesn't make me feel any better.

214
00:12:00,814 --> 00:12:02,544
S-Sorry.

215
00:12:03,984 --> 00:12:05,184
Don't worry about it.

216
00:12:05,454 --> 00:12:07,474
I got to go. I have morning practice.

217
00:12:10,354 --> 00:12:14,884
That boy though, he's not very kind, is he?

218
00:12:15,194 --> 00:12:17,424
He's almost like Fujimoto.

219
00:12:18,064 --> 00:12:21,694
Oh no! If I'm late, he'll be mean again!

220
00:12:27,574 --> 00:12:29,904
You are one minute and
twenty-three seconds late.

221
00:12:30,784 --> 00:12:32,644
O-One minute?

222
00:12:32,944 --> 00:12:35,214
Late is late whether it's one minute or not.

223
00:12:35,584 --> 00:12:37,384
I-I'm sorry.

224
00:12:38,854 --> 00:12:41,094
You were sleeping until the
last minute, weren't you?

225
00:12:41,094 --> 00:12:44,394
No. The floor mark is already gone.

226
00:12:44,394 --> 00:12:46,384
Don't tell me you fell out of your bedding.

227
00:12:46,764 --> 00:12:48,954
I don't have any bedding!

228
00:12:49,194 --> 00:12:50,184
Huh?

229
00:12:50,534 --> 00:12:52,434
Good morning, Kobato.

230
00:12:53,904 --> 00:12:56,204
Oh. Good morning.

231
00:12:57,134 --> 00:12:59,194
Has Fujimoto been giving you a hard time?

232
00:12:59,474 --> 00:13:01,444
Well, um...

233
00:13:02,614 --> 00:13:05,584
He's a bit rough around the edges,
but you know he's a good kid.

234
00:13:06,044 --> 00:13:08,644
Let me know if he hassles you, though.

235
00:13:09,414 --> 00:13:11,144
I'll give him the fist punishment!

236
00:13:11,524 --> 00:13:13,544
F-Fist?

237
00:13:14,024 --> 00:13:16,654
Yes. Like good old days.

238
00:13:17,394 --> 00:13:18,624
Old days?

239
00:13:19,994 --> 00:13:22,054
Hey, it's finally a nice day.

240
00:13:22,594 --> 00:13:24,154
We're airing out the bedding for nap time.

241
00:13:24,534 --> 00:13:27,464
Oh! Yes! I'm on my way!

242
00:13:30,474 --> 00:13:32,674
Goodbye, Kobato!

243
00:13:32,674 --> 00:13:35,574
Yes, goodbye!

244
00:13:38,914 --> 00:13:40,974
Looks like rain again.

245
00:13:41,984 --> 00:13:43,344
Kobato, do you have an umbrella?

246
00:13:43,554 --> 00:13:45,014
No, I don't.

247
00:13:45,884 --> 00:13:47,354
Fujimoto, you do, don't you?

248
00:13:47,694 --> 00:13:49,024
Why don't you two go home together?

249
00:13:49,254 --> 00:13:51,314
I'm busy after this.

250
00:13:51,924 --> 00:13:53,254
Kobato, take my umbrella.

251
00:13:53,764 --> 00:13:55,954
I wouldn't be caught dead sharing
an umbrella with you, anyway.

252
00:13:57,764 --> 00:13:59,594
Sharing an umbrella?

253
00:14:00,334 --> 00:14:02,774
Couples share one umbrella.

254
00:14:06,144 --> 00:14:08,904
Just like Ms. Sayaka said.

255
00:14:09,414 --> 00:14:11,974
It really started raining.

256
00:14:17,624 --> 00:14:18,674
Hey!

257
00:14:23,154 --> 00:14:27,424
The person who took it by accident
must have brought it back.

258
00:14:28,834 --> 00:14:30,424
Hey, Kobato?

259
00:14:30,904 --> 00:14:32,094
We meet again.

260
00:14:32,234 --> 00:14:34,324
Oh, Mutsumi Tadokoro!

261
00:14:34,674 --> 00:14:37,294
Just call me Mutsumi. What are you up to?

262
00:14:37,674 --> 00:14:39,834
The umbrella was returned!

263
00:14:40,104 --> 00:14:43,974
Huh? Why, that's great!

264
00:14:44,074 --> 00:14:47,874
Yes! Are you shopping again, Mutsumi?

265
00:14:48,114 --> 00:14:51,124
Yeah. Kendo practice is really tough.

266
00:14:51,124 --> 00:14:52,614
I'm always starving afterwards.

267
00:14:53,124 --> 00:14:55,024
You really put yourself into it.

268
00:14:55,794 --> 00:14:57,254
Oh, but uh...

269
00:14:58,524 --> 00:15:01,124
I can't eat too much or I'll get fat.

270
00:15:01,534 --> 00:15:02,824
Here. Why don't you take this?

271
00:15:03,094 --> 00:15:04,654
Are you sure?

272
00:15:05,034 --> 00:15:08,124
I'm sure. Here. See ya!

273
00:15:31,894 --> 00:15:34,954
That's a couple sharing an umbrella, isn't it?

274
00:15:42,574 --> 00:15:43,904
Mutsumi!

275
00:15:56,984 --> 00:15:58,614
Mutsumi...

276
00:15:59,124 --> 00:16:01,084
She was so sad.

277
00:16:02,224 --> 00:16:05,124
What can I do to make her feel better?

278
00:16:05,864 --> 00:16:09,164
I don't know. This one's a bit delicate.

279
00:16:13,264 --> 00:16:16,834
Good evening. Will you open the door, please?

280
00:16:20,604 --> 00:16:21,874
Yes?

281
00:16:28,084 --> 00:16:29,944
Oh my! Are you alright?

282
00:16:30,354 --> 00:16:31,474
Yes.

283
00:16:31,784 --> 00:16:33,814
Sorry to bother you.

284
00:16:34,494 --> 00:16:37,784
How do you do, I'm Chiho, the
apartment manager's daughter.

285
00:16:38,164 --> 00:16:39,384
I'm Chise.

286
00:16:39,594 --> 00:16:42,464
Oh, hello. My name is Kobato Hanato.

287
00:16:43,134 --> 00:16:44,804
We heard you didn't have any bedding.

288
00:16:44,804 --> 00:16:46,354
Uh, no.

289
00:16:46,464 --> 00:16:49,334
Our mother said to use this, if you like.

290
00:16:49,774 --> 00:16:51,394
Are you serious?!

291
00:16:51,644 --> 00:16:53,974
It's used, but if you don't mind.

292
00:16:54,974 --> 00:16:56,414
See you later!

293
00:16:57,244 --> 00:16:59,114
Thank you so very much!

294
00:17:02,314 --> 00:17:05,084
They gave me a futon!

295
00:17:05,584 --> 00:17:08,054
What good does it do you if you're
the one getting the healing?

296
00:17:08,394 --> 00:17:11,084
Oh, that's right.

297
00:17:11,994 --> 00:17:14,654
I'm going to get Mutsumi to feel better again.

298
00:17:14,994 --> 00:17:16,324
How do you plan to do that?

299
00:17:16,864 --> 00:17:19,494
Well... I'm just going to do my best!

300
00:17:23,304 --> 00:17:25,464
Hey. What are you planning to do?

301
00:17:26,204 --> 00:17:30,404
I think it's best you leave her alone for now.

302
00:17:35,654 --> 00:17:36,944
Excuse me!

303
00:17:38,984 --> 00:17:40,884
M-May I have a word with you?

304
00:17:41,694 --> 00:17:43,284
It's about Mutsumi!

305
00:17:49,534 --> 00:17:51,024
Please?!

306
00:17:51,934 --> 00:17:54,204
Ah, what do you mean?

307
00:17:54,204 --> 00:17:58,534
Like I said, I want you to share an
umbrella with Mutsumi, too.

308
00:18:01,374 --> 00:18:02,904
Please!

309
00:18:04,044 --> 00:18:06,574
What do you mean "Mutsumi, too," idiot.

310
00:18:07,384 --> 00:18:08,904
Is it not possible?

311
00:18:14,754 --> 00:18:16,454
Mutsumi!

312
00:18:17,724 --> 00:18:19,214
What's this all about?

313
00:18:20,524 --> 00:18:26,364
The other day... Well you had a
very sad expression, so...

314
00:18:29,734 --> 00:18:33,404
That time when you were sharing
an umbrella with another girl.

315
00:18:35,544 --> 00:18:37,374
I wasn't necessarily...

316
00:18:38,084 --> 00:18:39,844
Then why that expression?

317
00:18:40,814 --> 00:18:42,304
Well that was because...

318
00:18:44,754 --> 00:18:46,774
That was because...

319
00:19:10,614 --> 00:19:13,344
Excuse me if I've stuck my
foot in something here,

320
00:19:14,184 --> 00:19:18,554
but I just wanted Mutsumi to
feel better and smile again.

321
00:19:20,824 --> 00:19:21,984
So!

322
00:19:22,994 --> 00:19:26,584
Here! Please share this umbrella with Mutsumi!

323
00:19:26,724 --> 00:19:27,884
Huh?

324
00:19:27,964 --> 00:19:29,564
Kobato?

325
00:19:29,564 --> 00:19:31,154
I'm asking you.

326
00:19:35,174 --> 00:19:37,694
You'd be disappointing that other
girl, now wouldn't you?

327
00:19:45,784 --> 00:19:46,944
Get in.

328
00:19:47,284 --> 00:19:50,344
Wha... What's this? You don't have to do this!

329
00:19:51,284 --> 00:19:54,614
She's not my girlfriend or anything.

330
00:19:55,154 --> 00:19:56,384
Huh?

331
00:19:57,394 --> 00:20:00,724
That was just... well you see she said she forgot
her umbrella so I just walked her home.

332
00:20:00,724 --> 00:20:02,094
That's all.

333
00:20:08,474 --> 00:20:10,264
Mutsumi. Come on.

334
00:20:12,504 --> 00:20:14,604
What are you waiting for? Let's go!

335
00:20:14,844 --> 00:20:15,704
Uh!

336
00:20:24,384 --> 00:20:26,214
Katsuragi!

337
00:20:26,354 --> 00:20:29,344
Wait for me! Can't you see I'm getting wet?!

338
00:20:37,334 --> 00:20:38,854
Don't walk so close to me.

339
00:20:39,504 --> 00:20:41,024
Quit complaining.

340
00:20:41,174 --> 00:20:42,434
There's not enough room in here!

341
00:20:42,934 --> 00:20:44,004
You're impossible.

342
00:20:44,004 --> 00:20:45,374
But it's true.

343
00:20:45,574 --> 00:20:47,744
What do you expect me to do about it?
It's a small umbrella.

344
00:20:47,744 --> 00:20:51,304
Mutsumi doesn't look particularly happy.

345
00:20:52,044 --> 00:20:54,244
She's fine, she's fine.

346
00:20:55,214 --> 00:20:57,184
Is that right?

347
00:21:19,374 --> 00:21:21,744
This is strange, Ioryogi.

348
00:21:22,274 --> 00:21:23,644
What's strange?

349
00:21:24,444 --> 00:21:26,744
There's another kompeito.

350
00:21:27,484 --> 00:21:30,844
Isn't that why you mended her heart?

351
00:21:31,424 --> 00:21:37,184
I-I just wanted her to be happy
and helped out a bit.

352
00:21:39,424 --> 00:21:45,334
Oh well, whatever. Her heart was healed,
and that's what counts.

353
00:21:45,334 --> 00:21:46,964
Is that right?

354
00:21:46,964 --> 00:21:49,994
The increased kompeito is hard proof.

355
00:21:51,344 --> 00:21:53,534
Well that's good, then.

356
00:21:55,944 --> 00:21:58,504
I wonder if we're ever going to get through this.

357
00:22:05,754 --> 00:22:07,944
What was that I just sensed?

358
00:22:08,754 --> 00:22:10,624
What is it, Kohaku?

359
00:22:12,024 --> 00:22:15,824
Oh, it's nothing, Shuichiro.

360
00:22:16,464 --> 00:22:17,594
Let's go.

361
00:22:19,734 --> 00:22:22,604
It went pretty well this time.

362
00:22:23,174 --> 00:22:24,864
I guess I can give you a fairly high score.

363
00:22:25,544 --> 00:22:27,094
Are you serious?!

364
00:22:31,244 --> 00:22:34,144
Oh! Are you okay, Ioryogi-san?!

365
00:22:34,954 --> 00:22:39,544
Do... Ba... To...

366
00:22:41,054 --> 00:22:42,324
You get a ZERO!

367
00:22:42,324 --> 00:22:43,914
What?!

368
00:22:44,764 --> 00:22:46,624
You're mean, Ioryogi-san!

369
00:22:46,624 --> 00:22:48,494
You just said you'd give me a good score!

370
00:22:48,494 --> 00:22:51,864
It's all because of you that I'm
continually covered in mud and soot!

371
00:22:51,864 --> 00:22:55,474
It's okay. It will wash off in the rain!

372
00:22:55,474 --> 00:22:57,874
Nothing will wash off my anger!

373
00:22:57,874 --> 00:23:00,204
Oh, come on!

374
00:23:01,274 --> 00:23:08,914
Everyone dreams of flying

375
00:23:10,084 --> 00:23:16,184
But they let gravity trick them

376
00:23:16,454 --> 00:23:24,294
Honestly, everyone is already able to fly

377
00:23:26,534 --> 00:23:32,874
I bet the reason that child looks so terribly sad

378
00:23:33,904 --> 00:23:36,774
Is because he

379
00:23:36,774 --> 00:23:43,914
Accidentally lost his shadow somewhere

380
00:23:44,084 --> 00:23:46,614
In that case

381
00:23:46,784 --> 00:23:50,894
If I could just tell you, "Thank you,"

382
00:23:50,894 --> 00:23:54,764
And you laugh and reply, "Thank you"

383
00:23:54,764 --> 00:24:02,104
That exchange would fill you with joy

384
00:24:02,634 --> 00:24:06,864
It would make you feel so happy

385
00:24:07,174 --> 00:24:11,414
There's nothing to worry about

386
00:24:11,414 --> 00:24:15,504
Since we're together

387
00:24:17,284 --> 00:24:23,224
It's strange how I'm crying

388
00:24:23,224 --> 00:24:25,994
Even though I'm happy

389
00:24:25,994 --> 00:24:28,964
Next episode
...Spring Green and the Flutter of the Heart.
Even though I'm happy

390
00:24:28,964 --> 00:24:30,764
Next episode
...Spring Green and the Flutter of the Heart.

